{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/avelon-boulevard-avelon-developments-arjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":720,"crm_id":"1543","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Avelon Boulevard","slug":"avelon-boulevard-avelon-developments-arjan","display_address":"Arjan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Avelon Developments","price":660000,"display_price":"660K","lattitude":25.0942922,"longitude":55.2205984,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Avelon Boulevard is a residential development by Avelon Real Estate Development located in the vibrant Aryan district of ​​Dubai. The project offers <strong>studios, one and two bedroom apartments</strong>. Spacious and well-ventilated apartments of various types, enclosed suitable for every lifestyle.</p><p>The architectural brilliance of Avelon Boulevard is evident in its unique layouts and sophisticated design, creating a harmonious combination of aesthetics and functionality. Every detail of the property is carefully considered to provide residents with a superior living environment and fulfill aspirations for their dream property.</p><p>The residence boasts a large number of high-end amenities - swimming pool, locker rooms, fitness center and rejuvenating spa, etc., catering to a variety of leisure preferences and ensuring that residents can make the most of their leisure time. Thoughtful management of these amenities adds an extra level of luxury and convenience to the overall lifestyle.</p><p>Avelon Boulevard is an excellent location that provides access to major areas of Dubai and it takes a short drive away. Whether it’s the iconic Burj Al Arab, the bustling Dubai Hills Malls, or the Dubai International Airport, residents can easily access these key destinations, fostering a sense of connectivity and convenience.</p><p>Elevate your lifestyle with sophistication, comfort, and community connection in one of Dubai's most vibrant neighborhoods.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1543/images/2024/03/28/rkDa37P1j4bv5PMsgB3EyPNL8RWq6UG18EEU7t51.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/28/rkDa37P1j4bv5PMsgB3EyPNL8RWq6UG18EEU7t51.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1543/images/2024/03/28/IKg6kthIjWsEKEWChcH3II7HGiRdev9zjMxCfq9P.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/28/IKg6kthIjWsEKEWChcH3II7HGiRdev9zjMxCfq9P.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1543/images/2024/03/28/5tEF2LXdCGMA7QSjVdLN9xIaJ5R7R5K2L8GSMGl4.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/28/5tEF2LXdCGMA7QSjVdLN9xIaJ5R7R5K2L8GSMGl4.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1543/images/2024/03/28/2N8nuaQvEAryhMHktS3PaJgEPZr0tjqsRBOmfk6I.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/28/2N8nuaQvEAryhMHktS3PaJgEPZr0tjqsRBOmfk6I.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1543/images/2024/03/28/cnQ8KgWfcvsoDeHUtk6sA1exTBBcPpGDWUWUhSjB.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/28/cnQ8KgWfcvsoDeHUtk6sA1exTBBcPpGDWUWUhSjB.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1572,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":840,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"50/50","payment_plans":[{"id":4119,"title":"20%","description":"On booking"},{"id":4120,"title":"10%","description":"On 20% construction completion"},{"id":4121,"title":"10%","description":"On 40% construction completion"},{"id":4122,"title":"10%","description":"On 60% construction comple